esses with mental, physical, and financial wellbeing solutions to support workforce health and productivity."]},{"type":"p","children":["Physitrack Group’s solutions seamlessly integrate with existing systems, including EMR/EHR/PMS connectivity, and are trusted by more than 110,000 providers and organizations across 170+ countries. For more information, visit www.physitrackgroup.com and follow us on LinkedIn and X."]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Enquiries regarding this announcement should be addressed to:"]}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Corporate Contact:"]}]},{"type":"p","children":["Henrik Molin, CEO and co-founder, Physitrack"]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"url","params":{"url":"http://mailto:ir@physitrack.com","linkText":"ir@physitrack.com"}}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"url","params":{"url":"http://mailto:media@physitrack.com","linkText":"media@physitrack.com"}}]},{"type":"p","children":["+1 415 230 0414"]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Attachments"]}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://storage.mfn.se/f9a872cf-c7e5-4557-b890-fdf55160b198/physitrack-plc-transactions-under-share-buy-back-programme.pdf","linkText":"Physitrack PLC — Transactions under Share Buy-back Programme"}}]}]},"language":"en","tags":[{"title":"MFN by Modular Finance","args":[{"id":"provider","value":"modular_finance"}]},{"title":"Share buybacks","args":[{"id":"section","value":"share_buybacks"}]},{"title":"UK stocks","args":[{"id":"category","value":"stock"},{"id":"market_country","value":"GB"}]}],"id":"modular_finance:04212a82005e4:0","title":"Physitrack PLC — Transactions under Share Buy-back Programme","published":1792391400,"urgency":2,"relatedSymbols":[{"symbol":"OMXSTO:PTRK","logoid":"physitrack-plc","logo":{"style":"single","logoid":"physitrack-plc"}}],"storyPath":"/news/modular_finance:04212a82005e4:0-physitrack-plc-transactions-under-share-buy-back-programme/","read_time":95,"provide